{"id":"usado","lemma":"usado","pos":"adj","rank":1553,"glosses":["used","worn, worn-out"],"ipa":"/uˈsado/","forms":{"feminine":"usada","masculinePlural":"usados","femininePlural":"usadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-usado.wav","examples":[{"text":"Puede ser usado como un cuchillo.","en":"It can be used as a knife.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/517950","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to be"},null,{"g":"as"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"knife"}]},{"text":"¿Has usado mi cámara?","en":"Did you use my camera?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/122482","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"my"},{"g":"room"}]},{"text":"Él sabe cómo comprar autos usados.","en":"He knows how to buy used cars.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"how"},{"g":"to buy"},{"g":"a public deed or…","l":"auto"},null]},{"text":"Debería haber usado guantes.","en":"I should've worn gloves.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804253","words":[{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to have"},null,{"g":"glove","l":"guante"}]},{"text":"El inglés es usado por muchas personas.","en":"English is used by many people.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/635009","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"English"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"person (an individual","l":"persona"}]}]}